{
  "_comment": [
    "The achievements (services/Achievements). Edit here or on the owner's Settings page «Достижения: редактор»; «Опубликовать» ships the file.",
    "tier: one of `tiers` (easy first). icon: a pixel icon (widgets/Icons.js). secret: shown as ??? until earned.",
    "on: an event (services/Achievements → events, or act:<story/game.json action>), \"event:key\" for one kind; count: how many times (1); kinds: how many different keys instead.",
    "within: seconds — the `count` events must come in a row, each at most this long after the one before (\"Six windows in a row\"). hell: true — hell's own card (also any card while the demon rules).",
    "cond: a condition like the scenes' (docs/STORY.md) over the game's variables + days hour calmDays closeOwn mac earned chapters, count(\"event\") kinds(\"event\") got(\"id\"). With `on` both must hold.",
    "reward: a heaven thing it opens (or a thing of story/items.json: it lies in the card, e.g. the diary key) (services/Heaven → items); a thing no achievement gives is open to everyone. The game off: all of heaven is open, no achievements."
